<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Gruntal starts REITs.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Gruntal starts REITs.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Gruntal &amp; Co said it initiated coverage of several real estate investment trusts.</p>
<p>-- said it started Duke Realty Investments and Equity Residential Properties Trust with strong buy ratings.</p>
<p>-- started Kimco Realty Corp and New Plan Realty Trust with outperform ratings.</p>
<p>-- started Washington Real Estate Investment Trust as long-term outperform.</p>
</text>
